{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echo's Inc - Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Carlos, a hardworking employee finishing his shift at Echo\u2019s Inc. What starts as a quiet night quickly spirals into something far more disturbing. Strange noises echo through the halls, systems malfunction, and you\u2019re left to piece together what\u2019s really happening inside the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll experience the core gameplay of <i>Echo\u2019s Inc.</i> \u2014 immersive exploration, atmospheric horror, and tense puzzle-solving moments that reveal fragments of the larger mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments and ambient storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle narrative hints connecting to the main game\u2019s story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging puzzles that test logic and observation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, tense experience that builds toward the full release</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143110?t=1762361760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143110/b1e7fea8024d58e670ef9a5dab4566bff1a54206/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762361760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143110/567c9ab63f429b18d7807a586b20acba09a0c1a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762361760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143110/567c9ab63f429b18d7807a586b20acba09a0c1a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762361760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echo's Inc - Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Carlos, a hardworking employee finishing his shift at Echo\u2019s Inc. What starts as a quiet night quickly spirals into something far more disturbing. Strange noises echo through the halls, systems malfunction, and you\u2019re left to piece together what\u2019s really happening inside the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll experience the core gameplay of <i>Echo\u2019s Inc.</i> \u2014 immersive exploration, atmospheric horror, and tense puzzle-solving moments that reveal fragments of the larger mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments and ambient storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle narrative hints connecting to the main game\u2019s story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging puzzles that test logic and observation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, tense experience that builds toward the full release</p></li></ul>","developers":["UwRekening"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3039010","name":"Echo's Inc"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143110/8178954cfd32824259e77bff18f39ea0511ebce3/header.jpg?t=1762361760","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Echo's Inc Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<str